        "comments": "The assembly lpEriVagi1.hap1.2 is based on 65x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. This genome has been assembled using PacBio and HiC data and phased. The result is two curated haplotypes. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 7 (3.7 - 5.8 Mbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 8 (5.8 - 6.5 Mbp) are unknown. A haplotypic inversion was observed in the region on chromosome 26 (2.2-3 Mbp). A large number of centromeric repeats is in the unlocalised sequences.",
